IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BRNPOS001.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-ACCOUNT-NUMBER PIC X(12).
01 WS-CUSTOMER-ID PIC X(12).
01 WS-TRANSACTION-AMOUNT PIC 9(9)V99.
01 WS-RESPONSE-CODE PIC 9(4).
01 WS-RESPONSE-TEXT PIC X(50).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    PERFORM BATCH-INIT
    PERFORM PROCESS-TRANSACTIONS
    PERFORM BATCH-COMPLETE
    GOBACK.

BATCH-INIT.
    DISPLAY 'BATCH JOB BRNPOS001 STARTED'.
    MOVE 0000 TO WS-RESPONSE-CODE.

PROCESS-TRANSACTIONS.
    MOVE 'A00000000001' TO WS-ACCOUNT-NUMBER.
    MOVE 'C10001' TO WS-CUSTOMER-ID.
    MOVE 10000.00 TO WS-TRANSACTION-AMOUNT.
    
    CALL 'TXNWRT001' USING WS-ACCOUNT-NUMBER WS-CUSTOMER-ID
                          WS-TRANSACTION-AMOUNT 'DEP' 'USD'
                          'REF001' 'BATCH DEPOSIT' 'BRN'
                          'BATCH001' 'TERM001' WS-RESPONSE-CODE
                          WS-RESPONSE-TEXT.

    DISPLAY 'PROCESSED TRANSACTION FOR: ' WS-ACCOUNT-NUMBER.
    DISPLAY 'RESPONSE CODE: ' WS-RESPONSE-CODE.

BATCH-COMPLETE.
    DISPLAY 'BATCH JOB BRNPOS001 COMPLETED'.
    MOVE 0000 TO WS-RESPONSE-CODE.
    MOVE 'BATCH COMPLETED SUCCESSFULLY' TO WS-RESPONSE-TEXT.
